Description:
    Creates two channels speaking the y-websocket protocol, backed by the
    gem's document storage (Y::Document + Y::DocumentUpdate), and the
    migration for its tables. CollaborativeDocumentChannel serves
    record-bound documents (has_collaborative_document /
    has_collaborative_rich_text, authenticated by signed GlobalID);
    DocumentChannel serves free-standing documents addressed by key.

Example:
    bin/rails generate yrby:install

    This will create:
        app/channels/collaborative_document_channel.rb
        app/channels/document_channel.rb
        db/migrate/XXXXXXXX_create_y_tables.rb
